ked i used to do a lot of  the questions by email someone who asked  me a question i'd answer back and i  thought hey there's got to be a better  way to reach more people and help other  people have the same problem so i  started the videos and wednesdays have  become one of my favorite days of the  week because i know I get to sit down  and even though I'm just talking to the  camera right now I know people are  watching and I'm able to help them and I  hopefully help motivate you to keep  going with your business and not feel so  alone and not feel so hopeless with  what's going on with your company  because we're all going through the same  things and the best part of my day  really every day is when I wake up I go  to the computer I make myself my  breakfast which is usually lentils with  some cut up hot dogs in it sounds gross  right but it's actually pretty good my  mom has some an awesome homemade lentil  recipe that I use so it's awesome and I  load up my computer and I look at my  youtube comments and every day there's  like 20 comments in there people who  have loved the videos asking questions  saying keep going and that fuels me to  keep going making more videos for you  and so I just want to say thank you half  a million views is all is is great I  want to get to the next step hopefully  you guys will keep asking questions keep  giving me likes keep leaving comments  below and that will fuel me to keep  going and hopefully together we can all  build massive successes with our  businesses my goal is to help a billion  entrepreneurs and you guys are help  helping part of that movement happen so  thank you for those of you watching as  you always do please leave a thumbs up  below thank you so much for my half a  million views and if you have a question  for your business I'd love to try to  answer for you I always read the  comments as you just heard me say so  leave it in the comments section below  any question you have your company I  always read those